      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "summary": "What this topic covers.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "topic-map",
          "html": "<p>Your phone knows more about you than any other device: where you go, who you talk to, your photos, your health and your money. Much of that is shared with apps, advertisers and your carrier by default. A few settings &mdash; app permissions, location history, the advertising ID and a strong passcode &mdash; make a big difference, whatever phone you have.</p>"
        }
      ]
